app_description:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BeamNG.drive Mobile&lt;/strong&gt; is a realistic driving and vehicle simulation game designed for mobile devices. Experience detailed cars, realistic physics, challenging roads, exciting crashes, and dynamic driving environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore different maps, drive a variety of vehicles, customize your cars, and test their limits with realistic vehicle damage and physics. Whether you enjoy racing, drifting, off-road driving, or spectacular crashes, BeamNG.drive Mobile offers an immersive driving experience on your phone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Realistic vehicle physics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Detailed cars and environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Realistic crashes and vehicle damage&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Multiple driving locations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Car customization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Racing, drifting, and off-road challenges&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Smooth and immersive mobile gameplay&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
